{"seq":1,"slug":"listing-takedown-link-remove","title":"商品/链接下架执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/takedown-counternotice/listing-takedown-link-remove","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品-链接下架执行\">商品/链接下架执行</h1><p>判定结论是「这个链接侵权」，执行动作是「让它从货架上消失」。这两者之间隔着一整套必须严谨的工程——因为下架是这套系统里唯一会直接改变卖家经营状态的动作，它一旦做错，损失无法靠一条日志挽回。本篇讲下架执行的对象模型、幂等设计和状态机，以及一个经常被忽视的问题：<strong>下架的范围到底是多大。</strong></p>\n<p>范围问题不是细节。下架一个 SKU 还是整个 listing、一个站点还是全球、一个变体还是整个变体族，直接决定了这次执法的实际影响面。判定员说「这个商品侵权」，系统却把该卖家的整个店铺冻结了——这是执行层最常见的越界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-下架对象的三层粒度\">核心概念：下架对象的三层粒度</h2><p>商品在平台上的表示是分层的，下架必须在正确的层上操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>下架影响</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>具体可售单元</td>\n<td>最小影响，仅该 SKU 停售</td>\n<td>能精确定位到侵权 SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listing</td>\n<td>商品详情页（含变体）</td>\n<td>整页不可售，含全部变体</td>\n<td>侵权点在整个 listing（如标题、主图）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>店铺/账号</td>\n<td>卖家全部商品</td>\n<td>最大影响</td>\n<td>仅限累犯处置，不用于单次判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>判定结论指向哪一层，下架就在哪一层执行，不多一层。</strong> 如果侵权点在某个变体 SKU 的图片上（例如只有黑色款的图盗用了版权图），下架该 SKU 即可，不应连带把该 listing 下所有颜色一起下掉。反之如果侵权点在 listing 标题或主图上，只下架 SKU 无法解决问题——标题还在，搜索仍能命中——此时必须在 listing 层下架。</p>\n<p>这个判断不能靠人工每次决定，应当由判定结论<strong>携带目标层级</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;dec_20260927_0091&quot;,&#10;  &quot;complaint_id&quot;: &quot;c_20260927_0041&quot;,&#10;  &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;infringing&quot;,&#10;  &quot;infringing_elements&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;logo&quot;, &quot;location&quot;: &quot;variant_image&quot;, &quot;variant_id&quot;: &quot;V-BLK&quot;, &quot;matched_mark&quot;: &quot;ACME&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;takedown_scope&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;level&quot;: &quot;sku&quot;,&#10;    &quot;site&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;    &quot;targets&quot;: [{ &quot;listing_id&quot;: &quot;B0XXXXXXXX&quot;, &quot;sku_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-9931&quot; }]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dec_20260927_0091\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"complaint_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c_20260927_0041\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"infringing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"infringing_elements\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"logo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"location\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"variant_image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"variant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"V-BLK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matched_mark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACME\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"takedown_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"listing_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B0XXXXXXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-9931\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>判定侧明确给出 <code>level</code> 与精确 targets，执行侧只负责忠实执行——职责分离让「下架范围过宽」成为判定侧可审计的错误，而不是执行侧无法追责的黑箱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-为什么下架必须有幂等键\">幂等：为什么下架必须有幂等键</h2><p>同一个判定可能被多次投递：判定服务重试、消息队列至少一次投递、运维手工重放、批量任务与实时任务重叠。下架若不幂等，后果不是「多下一次」，而是<strong>状态被反复改写</strong>——例如一个已经被卖家申诉恢复的链接，被一条延迟重放的旧下架指令再次打掉，且这次没有任何新的判定依据。</p>\n<p>幂等键应当由「判定对象 + 判定依据 + 生效动作」构成，而不是随机生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"idempotency_key = sha256(&#10;  listing_id + &quot;|&quot; + sku_id + &quot;|&quot; + site + &quot;|&quot; +&#10;  decision_id + &quot;|&quot; + action   // action = takedown|restore&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>idempotency_key = sha256(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  listing_id + \"|\" + sku_id + \"|\" + site + \"|\" +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decision_id + \"|\" + action   // action = takedown|restore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>decision_id</code> 是关键组成部分，不是 <code>complaint_id</code>。理由：同一条投诉可能对不同目标产出不同判定（见 <a href=\"../infringement-report-evidence/ip-complaint-intake-type\">侵权投诉受理与类型</a>），而同一目标的判定在申诉后可能被推翻并重新出具。用 <code>decision_id</code> 让每次<strong>独立的判定结论</strong>对应一个独立的下架动作，既保证同一判定的重放幂等，又允许新判定合法地产生新动作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE takedown_action (&#10;  id               BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  idempotency_key  CHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  decision_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  complaint_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  level            VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,   -- sku|listing|store&#10;  site             VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  listing_id       VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id           VARCHAR(64),&#10;  action           VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,   -- takedown|restore&#10;  reason_code      VARCHAR(48) NOT NULL,&#10;  state            VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- queued|applied|failed|reverted&#10;  applied_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  reverted_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  UNIQUE (idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_takedown_listing ON takedown_action (listing_id, site, state);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_takedown_decision ON takedown_action (decision_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> takedown_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  complaint_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- sku|listing|store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  site</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  listing_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- takedown|restore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- queued|applied|failed|reverted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applied_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reverted_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_takedown_listing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> takedown_action (listing_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">site</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_takedown_decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> takedown_action (decision_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (idempotency_key)</code> 是幂等的物理保证——重复投递会在插入时冲突，执行器捕获冲突即视为已处理。这比「先查再插」更可靠，因为查与插之间存在竞态窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行状态机\">执行状态机</h2><p>下架不是一次数据库更新，而是跨多个下游系统的动作：商品服务要改可售状态、搜索索引要移除、推荐要下线、通知服务要告知卖家、财务可能要冻结相关结算。这些子系统不可能同时成功，因此执行必须是一个<strong>有补偿的状态机</strong>，而非一个事务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; queued: 判定结论落地&#10;  queued --&gt; applying: 执行器领取&#10;  applying --&gt; applied: 主状态变更成功&#10;  applying --&gt; partial: 部分下游失败&#10;  applying --&gt; failed: 主状态变更失败&#10;  partial --&gt; applied: 补偿重试成功&#10;  partial --&gt; failed: 超过重试上限&#10;  failed --&gt; queued: 人工/定时重试&#10;  failed --&gt; abandoned: 标记为需人工处理&#10;  applied --&gt; reverted: 反通知/申诉成立&#10;  reverted --&gt; [*]&#10;  abandoned --&gt; [*]&#10;  applied --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; queued: 判定结论落地\n  queued --&gt; applying: 执行器领取\n  applying --&gt; applied: 主状态变更成功\n  applying --&gt; partial: 部分下游失败\n  applying --&gt; failed: 主状态变更失败\n  partial --&gt; applied: 补偿重试成功\n  partial --&gt; failed: 超过重试上限\n  failed --&gt; queued: 人工/定时重试\n  failed --&gt; abandoned: 标记为需人工处理\n  applied --&gt; reverted: 反通知/申诉成立\n  reverted --&gt; [*]\n  abandoned --&gt; [*]\n  applied --&gt; [*]</pre><h3 id=\"主状态与副状态要分清\">主状态与副状态要分清</h3><p><code>applied</code> 的定义必须明确到「哪一个状态变了才算下架生效」。合理定义是：<strong>商品的可售状态（sellable）已变为不可售</strong>——这是阻断交易的关键状态。搜索索引移除、推荐下线是副状态，它们失败会让商品仍能被搜到（体验问题），但不能算作下架失败。反过来，如果主状态没变而副状态都成功了，那是<strong>假装下架</strong>——最危险的一种失败，必须判为 <code>failed</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"部分失败的处理\">部分失败的处理</h3><p><code>partial</code> 状态的存在是为了让「主状态成功但副状态失败」的情况获得自动补偿，而不是被当成整体失败反复重试主状态。执行器需要知道每个下游的重试策略，并且补偿动作本身也要幂等（同一个索引删除请求重复投递必须无害）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"execution_plan(level=sku, target=SKU-9931):&#10;  1. catalog.set_sellable(listing, sku, false)      # 主状态, 阻塞式, 失败即 failed&#10;  2. search.remove(listing, sku)                    # 副状态, 可重试&#10;  3. reco.suppress(listing, sku)                    # 副状态, 可重试&#10;  4. notify.seller(seller_party, decision_id)       # 通知, 不影响判定&#10;  5. audit.append(decision_id, action, state)       # 审计, 必达\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>execution_plan(level=sku, target=SKU-9931):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. catalog.set_sellable(listing, sku, false)      # 主状态, 阻塞式, 失败即 failed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. search.remove(listing, sku)                    # 副状态, 可重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. reco.suppress(listing, sku)                    # 副状态, 可重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. notify.seller(seller_party, decision_id)       # 通知, 不影响判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. audit.append(decision_id, action, state)       # 审计, 必达</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 5 步不可省略。审计事件是第 4 章所有度量与审计（见 <a href=\"../ip-enforcement-ops/ip-enforcement-audit\">执法记录审计与统计</a>）的唯一数据来源，它必须与执行动作绑定落库，而不是事后从应用日志里捞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下架通知-必须给出理由\">下架通知：必须给出理由</h2><p>下架卖家通知不是客服礼仪，而是合规要求。DSA 规定，托管服务提供者对内容采取移除、禁用访问、降级等限制时，须向受影响的服务接受者提供<strong>清晰、具体的理由说明</strong>（statement of reasons），载明限制的事实、依据的条款、以及救济途径；且理由说明须在限制生效时或之前提供（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32022R2065\">DSA Article 17</a>）。这意味着下架执行流程里必须包含「生成结构化理由」这一步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;notice_id&quot;: &quot;tn_20260927_0091&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;dec_20260927_0091&quot;,&#10;  &quot;recipient_party&quot;: 55201,&#10;  &quot;restriction&quot;: &quot;listing_sku_disabled&quot;,&#10;  &quot;facts&quot;: &quot;被投诉 SKU 的商品图片使用了 ACME 注册商标标识，投诉方为商标权利人。&quot;,&#10;  &quot;legal_basis&quot;: &quot;platform_ip_policy §3.2 / trademark&quot;,&#10;  &quot;redress&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;counter_notice_url&quot;: &quot;/ip/counter-notice?decision=dec_20260927_0091&quot;,&#10;    &quot;window_days&quot;: 20&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;issued_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T05:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notice_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_20260927_0091\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dec_20260927_0091\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"recipient_party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"restriction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"listing_sku_disabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"facts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"被投诉 SKU 的商品图片使用了 ACME 注册商标标识，投诉方为商标权利人。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_ip_policy §3.2 / trademark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"redress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"counter_notice_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/ip/counter-notice?decision=dec_20260927_0091\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issued_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T05:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>redress.counter_notice_url</code> 与窗口天数是通知里最实质的部分——它必须指回<strong>这次判定</strong>，而不是一个泛泛的申诉页面。卖家点进去时，系统应当已经带着 <code>decision_id</code> 预填了上下文，否则申诉要先让卖家自己说明「我是因为哪次下架来的」，这本身就是摩擦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>下架是唯一直接改变卖家经营状态的动作，执行错误不可用日志挽回。</li>\n<li>下架有 SKU / listing / store 三层粒度，判定结论必须携带目标层级，执行侧忠实执行。</li>\n<li>幂等键应由「判定对象 + decision_id + 动作」构成，用唯一约束物理保证幂等，而非先查再插。</li>\n<li>用 decision_id 而非 complaint_id 做键，允许申诉推翻后的新判定合法产生新动作。</li>\n<li>执行是跨多下游的补偿状态机；「可售状态变更」是主状态，搜索/推荐是副状态。</li>\n<li>主状态未变而副状态成功 = 假装下架，必须判为失败。</li>\n<li>下架通知必须结构化给出事实、法律依据与救济途径（DSA Art 17），并携带 decision_id 回指判定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品/链接下架执行","id":"商品-链接下架执行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：下架对象的三层粒度","id":"核心概念-下架对象的三层粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等：为什么下架必须有幂等键","id":"幂等-为什么下架必须有幂等键"},{"level":2,"text":"执行状态机","id":"执行状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"主状态与副状态要分清","id":"主状态与副状态要分清"},{"level":3,"text":"部分失败的处理","id":"部分失败的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"下架通知：必须给出理由","id":"下架通知-必须给出理由"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"假货线索提交与品牌协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/infringement-report-evidence/counterfeit-clue-submit"},"next":{"title":"反通知、申诉与误杀恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/takedown-counternotice/counter-notice-restore"}}